  "content": "#### Epilogue: Holy Ruler\nVeric Nero seizes the palace balcony and declares himself **Lord Regent**, restoring church rule under the Church of Aurtus and freeing the children. While the crowds rejoice, Nero’s burned face reflects a bitter hatred of all mages. Corliss reforms the Wardens, and Marcus—haunted by the Empress’s dying warning of an entity *“thrumming from across the waters”*—mounts his great cat and rides northward alone into the uncharted wilderness.",
